#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:5 55c37cc811f44972a4b33e170abec68e
msgid "Sport Mode"
msgstr "Sport 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:7 8185b1968c2546a59da4a15a81cedb10
msgid ""
"Sport Mode is also known as \"rate controlled stabilize\" plus Altitude "
"Hold."
msgstr "Sport 模式也被称为\"速率控制自稳\"加高度保持。"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:10 ca163aaf3f124294bbca0292f2a67a6c
msgid ""
"this mode is not included by default in the firmware built and available on "
"the `Firmware Server <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ . Either the user "
"must build his own firmware with this mode enabled or use the `Custom "
"Firmware Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"
msgstr ""
"此模式不包含在 `固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"上构建和提供的默认固件中。用户需要自行构建启用了此模式的固件，或使用 `自定义固件服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:13 19a52a93657d4f43a9ea3cae190858f5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:15 0b008731dc5f4f6897e3781aa7944f0b
msgid ""
"It was designed to be useful for flying FPV and filming `dolly shots "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dolly_shot>`__ or fly bys because you can set"
" the vehicle at a particular angle and it will maintain that angle."
msgstr ""
"该模式设计用于 FPV 飞行和拍摄 `移动镜头 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dolly_shot>`__ "
"（即跟踪拍摄）或飞越拍摄，因为您可以将飞行器固定在特定角度并保持该角度不变。"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:18 4233351b22d341dc949e423e527a9e64
msgid ""
"The pilot's roll, pitch and yaw sticks control the rate of rotation of the "
"vehicle so when the sticks are released the vehicle will remain in its "
"current attitude."
msgstr "飞手的横滚、俯仰和偏航摇杆控制飞行器的旋转速率，因此当摇杆释放时，飞行器将保持当前姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:21 87ff428505e346238f458826c7952eaf
msgid ""
"The vehicle will not lean more than 45 degrees (this angle is adjustable "
"with the :ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL <ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` and :ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH "
"<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` parameters)"
msgstr ""
"飞行器倾斜角不会超过 45 度（此角度可通过 :ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL <ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` 和 "
":ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH <ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` 参数调整）"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:23 35528649ac6f4056a1c4ae8d30d0216f
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The altitude is maintained with the altitude hold controller so the vehicle "
"will attempt to hold its current altitude when the sticks are placed with "
"10% of mid-throttle. It will climb or descend at up to 2.5m/s (this speed is"
" adjustable with the :ref:`PILOT_SPEED_UP<PILOT_SPEED_UP>` and "
":ref:`PILOT_SPEED_DN<PILOT_SPEED_DN>` parameters). The acceleration used to "
"establish these speeds is set by :ref:`PILOT_ACCEL_Z<PILOT_ACCEL_Z>`."
msgstr ""
"高度由高度保持控制器维持，当摇杆处于中位油门 10% 范围内时，飞行器将尝试保持当前高度。飞行器可以以最高 2.5m/s 的速度爬升或下降（此速度可通过"
" :ref:`PILOT_SPEED_UP<PILOT_SPEED_UP>` 和 "
":ref:`PILOT_SPEED_DN<PILOT_SPEED_DN>` 参数调整）。用于达到这些速度的加速度由 "
":ref:`PILOT_ACCEL_Z<PILOT_ACCEL_Z>` 设定。"
